+/*
+ * MediaTek MT6897 MM clock gates (dispsys0/1, ovlsys0/1, mminfra).
+ *
+ * Gates marked HWV are switched through the hardware voter (infra HW_CCF):
+ * the AP votes in its SET/CLR bank and waits for the voter's DONE bit. The
+ * others use the subsystem's own CG set/clr registers. The blocks sit in
+ * the MM power domains. Data from the MediaTek vendor driver (MiCode
+ * MTK_kernel_device_modules 3c4ccd07, drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt6897-mmsys.c).
+ */
